  NbUi("<b>NbUi</b><br/>In-game HUD: cheese count, toasts, health pips, exposure/rot/door meters, win/fail overlay.")
  NbYard("<b>NbYard</b><br/>Backyard level: scattered cover points around a wide-open centre, patrolled by guards with flashlights.")
